(37, 25, 'Prompt Engineering 101 - A Course', 'Learn all about Prompt Engineering from AssemblyAI in this Beginner Crash Course. In this video you will learn all the basics of prompt engineering so you can get the best results when working with Large Language Models.  This is not a list with the best ChatGPT prompts. Instead, we compiled the best resources we found into one straightforward guide that teaches you basic concepts and the fundamentals of prompt engineering.', '', 'text', 14, 2, 'published', 1, 'https://youtu.be/aOm75o2Z5-o', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-28 19:41:18', '2025-07-28 19:41:19', NULL, 'Automatic transcript retrieval requires OAuth authentication. Please use OAuth flow or manually add transcript. Video title: Prompt Engineering 101 - Crash Course & Tips'),
