(581, 168, 'MCP - Model Context Protocol - SDK - Python', 'In this video we look at how to use the MCP Protocol - created by Anthropic (Claude) . The Python SDK allows you to create your own MCP Server. This enables you to provide additional tools, prompts and resources to your LLM (or Claude Desktop).', '', 'text', 18, 3, 'published', 1, 'https://youtu.be/oq3dkNm51qc', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-29 00:48:45', '2025-07-31 19:53:21', NULL, 'Automatic transcript retrieval requires OAuth authentication. Please use OAuth flow or manually add transcript. Video title: MCP - Model Context Protocol - SDK - Python'),
