(303, 21, 'In the context of MCP, what is meant by \"model collaboration\"?', 'multiple_choice', '\"Model collaboration\" refers to multiple models working together to achieve common goals, facilitated by the context shared through MCP.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 19:59:43', '2025-07-31 19:59:43'),
