(346, 25, 'What is the primary function of prompt engineering in the context of artificial intelligence?', 'multiple_choice', 'Prompt engineering focuses on crafting inputs that guide AI systems to produce more accurate and relevant outputs.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(347, 25, 'Which of the following best describes the role of OAuth authentication in automatic transcript retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth authentication is a secure method that verifies user identities before granting access to sensitive data such as transcripts.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(348, 25, 'What is a key benefit of using effective prompts in AI systems?', 'multiple_choice', 'Well-crafted prompts can greatly enhance the quality of the output generated by AI systems by guiding the AI more effectively.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(349, 25, 'Why is it important to understand the audience when engineering prompts?', 'multiple_choice', 'Understanding the audience allows prompt engineers to design prompts that yield responses tailored to the specific needs and preferences of users.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(350, 25, 'Which of the following is a common challenge faced in prompt engineering?', 'multiple_choice', 'One of the main challenges in prompt engineering is creating prompts that consistently lead to the desired and relevant responses from AI systems.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(351, 25, 'What is an example of a well-structured prompt?', 'multiple_choice', 'A well-structured prompt provides clear guidance and context, which helps the AI generate a focused response.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(352, 25, 'In which scenario would prompt engineering be least applicable?', 'multiple_choice', 'Prompt engineering is primarily relevant in contexts involving text generation or interaction, whereas user interface design does not typically involve prompts.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(353, 25, 'What role does iteration play in the prompt engineering process?', 'multiple_choice', 'Iteration is essential in prompt engineering as it helps refine and improve prompts based on user feedback and the effectiveness of previous iterations.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(354, 25, 'Which of the following statements about prompt clarity is true?', 'multiple_choice', 'Ambiguous prompts can confuse AI systems, leading to responses that do not meet user expectations.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(355, 25, 'What is the significance of context in prompt engineering?', 'multiple_choice', 'Context provides necessary background information that helps AI systems generate responses that are more relevant and appropriate to user queries.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(356, 25, 'Which type of feedback is most beneficial in refining prompts?', 'multiple_choice', 'User experience feedback that focuses on the relevance and quality of responses is crucial for improving the effectiveness of prompts.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(357, 25, 'How does the specificity of a prompt impact AI-generated responses?', 'multiple_choice', 'Specific prompts guide the AI to produce more targeted and relevant responses, while vague prompts can lead to broader and less useful outputs.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(358, 25, 'Which of the following is an essential quality of effective prompts?', 'multiple_choice', 'Clarity is a vital quality of effective prompts, as it ensures that the AI understands what is being asked, leading to better responses.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(359, 25, 'What is one potential consequence of poorly designed prompts in AI systems?', 'multiple_choice', 'Poorly designed prompts can confuse AI systems, resulting in outputs that do not satisfy user needs, leading to frustration.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(360, 25, 'Why is it important for prompt engineers to stay updated on AI advancements?', 'multiple_choice', 'Staying informed about AI advancements allows prompt engineers to leverage new capabilities and understand any limitations that may affect their prompt designs.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:15', '2025-07-31 20:06:15'),
(361, 26, 'What is the primary purpose of prompt engineering in artificial intelligence?', 'multiple_choice', 'Prompt engineering focuses on crafting inputs that lead to better and more accurate responses from AI models.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:55', '2025-07-31 20:06:55'),
(362, 26, 'Which of the following best describes the OAuth authentication process mentioned in the context of automatic transcript retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth is a protocol used for authentication and authorization, allowing secure access to resources without sharing credentials.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:55', '2025-07-31 20:06:55'),
(363, 26, 'What is one key aspect of creating effective prompts for AI systems?', 'multiple_choice', 'Effective prompts should provide clear and specific context to guide the AI in generating relevant responses.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:55', '2025-07-31 20:06:55'),
(364, 26, 'Which of the following is NOT a benefit of prompt engineering?', 'multiple_choice', 'While prompt engineering can enhance response quality and user satisfaction, it does not necessarily increase processing speed.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:55', '2025-07-31 20:06:55'),
(365, 26, 'In the context of AI, what does the term \"model interpretability\" refer to?', 'multiple_choice', 'Model interpretability pertains to how easily users can comprehend the reasoning behind a model\'s outputs.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:55', '2025-07-31 20:06:55');
