(368, 26, 'How does prompt specificity influence AI performance?', 'multiple_choice', 'More specific prompts generally help direct the AI to generate more relevant and precise responses.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:06:55', '2025-07-31 20:06:55'),
