(481, 34, 'What is a potential drawback of using the free version of Hugging Face as mentioned in the transcript?', 'multiple_choice', 'The transcript notes that the free version of Hugging Face may throttle download speeds, particularly for large files.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:14', '2025-07-31 20:30:14'),
(482, 34, 'What is the primary audience for models showcased on Hugging Face Spaces?', 'multiple_choice', 'The models showcased on Hugging Face Spaces are primarily targeted at other developers within the community.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:14', '2025-07-31 20:30:14'),
(483, 34, 'What type of environment does Hugging Face provide for testing models?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face Spaces provide an interactive environment where users can test and explore models.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:15', '2025-07-31 20:30:15'),
(484, 34, 'Which of the following is NOT mentioned as a feature of Hugging Face?', 'multiple_choice', 'Video conferencing tools are not mentioned as a feature of Hugging Face; the focus is on models, datasets, and social networking.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:15', '2025-07-31 20:30:15'),
(485, 34, 'What is the significance of the \"access tokens\" mentioned in the context of Hugging Face?', 'multiple_choice', 'Access tokens provide secure access to various resources on Hugging Face, including programmatic interactions.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:15', '2025-07-31 20:30:15'),
(486, 34, 'What aspect of Hugging Face makes it similar to a social media platform?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face allows users to follow each other and their repositories, similar to social media interactions.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:15', '2025-07-31 20:30:15'),
(487, 34, 'Why is it important for users of Hugging Face to have an account?', 'multiple_choice', 'Having an account on Hugging Face is crucial for effectively participating in the AI ecosystem, as it provides access to models and datasets.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:15', '2025-07-31 20:30:15'),
(488, 35, 'What is the primary function of Hugging Face?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face is primarily focused on natural language processing (NLP) tasks, offering tools and models for various NLP applications.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(489, 35, 'Which authentication method is required for automatic transcript retrieval in the context of Hugging Face?', 'multiple_choice', 'Automatic transcript retrieval requires OAuth authentication, which is a standard method for securing access to APIs.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(490, 35, 'What is a common use case for Hugging Face models?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face models are widely used for text generation, among other natural language processing tasks.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(491, 35, 'What does the term \'OAuth flow\' refer to in the context of Hugging Face?', 'multiple_choice', 'The OAuth flow refers to the process used for securely authenticating users and granting access to applications.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(492, 35, 'Which of the following is NOT a feature of Hugging Face?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face does not focus on video processing, but rather on natural language processing and related tasks.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(493, 35, 'In what way does Hugging Face promote collaboration among developers?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face fosters collaboration by allowing developers to share models and datasets within its community.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(494, 35, 'Which of the following best describes the type of content Hugging Face models are typically trained on?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face models are primarily trained on unstructured textual data, which is essential for natural language processing tasks.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(495, 35, 'What is one of the key benefits of using pre-trained models in Hugging Face?', 'multiple_choice', 'Pre-trained models save time and resources by allowing users to leverage existing models instead of training from scratch.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(496, 35, 'Which programming language is primarily used for implementing models from Hugging Face?', 'multiple_choice', 'Python is the primary programming language used for implementing and interacting with models from Hugging Face.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(497, 35, 'What role does documentation play in the Hugging Face ecosystem?', 'multiple_choice', 'Documentation is crucial as it provides users with detailed guidelines for effectively using and implementing models from Hugging Face.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(498, 35, 'How does Hugging Face support the academic community?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face supports the academic community by providing free access to a range of models and datasets for research and educational purposes.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(499, 35, 'What is a potential outcome of using Hugging Face for language translation tasks?', 'multiple_choice', 'Utilizing Hugging Face for language translation can enhance both the quality and efficiency of translations due to its advanced NLP models.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(500, 35, 'What distinguishes Hugging Face from other AI platforms?', 'multiple_choice', 'Hugging Face is distinguished by its extensive library of natural language processing models, which are readily accessible to users.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(501, 35, 'In the context of Hugging Face, what does \"model sharing\" refer to?', 'multiple_choice', 'Model sharing refers to developers uploading and distributing their trained models for others to use, fostering collaboration within the community.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(502, 35, 'What is an important consideration when using Hugging Face for business applications?', 'multiple_choice', 'An important consideration is the potential need to fine-tune models for specific business applications to ensure they meet particular performance requirements.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:37', '2025-07-31 20:30:37'),
(503, 36, 'What is required for automatic transcript retrieval in Google Colab?', 'multiple_choice', 'Automatic transcript retrieval necessitates OAuth authentication to ensure secure access.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(504, 36, 'What is the primary function of Google Colab?', 'multiple_choice', 'Google Colab serves as an IDE specifically designed for Python programming, enabling users to write and execute code in a collaborative environment.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(505, 36, 'Which of the following is a method mentioned for adding transcripts in Google Colab?', 'multiple_choice', 'The OAuth flow is one of the methods highlighted for adding transcripts automatically.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(506, 36, 'What is the significance of using OAuth in Google Colab?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth provides a secure method for accessing user data by authenticating requests, which is crucial for features like transcript retrieval.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(507, 36, 'In the context of Google Colab, what does the term \"manual add transcript\" refer to?', 'multiple_choice', '\"Manual add transcript\" refers to the action of entering transcript text directly into the Google Colab notebook.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(508, 36, 'Who is the target audience for the Google Colab tutorial referenced in the transcript?', 'multiple_choice', 'The tutorial is designed for beginners, providing foundational knowledge on using Google Colab.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(509, 36, 'What does the tutorial aim to explain about Google Colab?', 'multiple_choice', 'The primary focus of the tutorial is to explain the basic features and functionalities of Google Colab.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(510, 36, 'Which of the following best describes Google Colab\'s environment?', 'multiple_choice', 'Google Colab offers a collaborative, cloud-based platform that allows multiple users to work together.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(511, 36, 'What is one potential advantage of using Google Colab for coding?', 'multiple_choice', 'A significant advantage of Google Colab is its capacity for real-time collaboration, facilitating teamwork among users.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(512, 36, 'Which of the following features is NOT typically associated with Google Colab?', 'multiple_choice', 'Google Colab primarily functions online, and offline data processing capabilities are not a typical feature associated with it.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(513, 36, 'What type of authentication does Google Colab specifically use for security?', 'multiple_choice', 'Google Colab uses OAuth authentication to securely manage access to user data and features.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(514, 36, 'Which of the following best describes the purpose of the video titled \"Google Colab Tutorial for Beginners\"?', 'multiple_choice', 'The purpose of the video is to introduce beginners to Google Colab and explain its functionalities.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(515, 36, 'How does Google Colab facilitate learning in data science?', 'multiple_choice', 'Google Colab facilitates learning in data science by offering a user-friendly interface that allows individuals to write and execute code easily.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(516, 36, 'What is a key feature that distinguishes Google Colab from traditional programming environments?', 'multiple_choice', 'A distinguishing feature of Google Colab is its cloud-based operation, which allows access from anywhere with internet connectivity.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(517, 36, 'What can users expect to gain from the Google Colab tutorial for beginners?', 'multiple_choice', 'Users can expect to gain a basic understanding of the features and functionalities of Google Colab from the tutorial.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:30:53', '2025-07-31 20:30:53'),
(518, 37, 'What is the primary purpose of GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'GitHub is primarily used for hosting and sharing code repositories, facilitating collaboration among developers.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(519, 37, 'What authentication method is required for automatic transcript retrieval on GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'Automatic transcript retrieval on GitHub necessitates the use of OAuth authentication.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(520, 37, 'Which of the following is a key feature of GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'A key feature of GitHub is its version control system, which allows users to track changes in code over time.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(521, 37, 'What is meant by the term \"repository\" in the context of GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'A repository on GitHub is a storage space where code and project files are kept, enabling collaboration and version control.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(522, 37, 'How does GitHub facilitate collaboration among developers?', 'multiple_choice', 'GitHub facilitates collaboration among developers by providing tools for code review and issue tracking, enhancing teamwork and project management.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(523, 37, 'What is the significance of using the OAuth flow on GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'The OAuth flow is significant on GitHub as it enhances security for user authentication, protecting user data and access.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(524, 37, 'In GitHub, what does the term \"commit\" refer to?', 'multiple_choice', 'In GitHub, a \"commit\" refers to a snapshot of changes made to the code, capturing the state of the project at a specific point in time.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(525, 37, 'Which of the following best describes the concept of \"branching\" in GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'Branching in GitHub allows users to create different versions of a project, enabling experimentation without affecting the main codebase.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(526, 37, 'What role do \"issues\" play in project management on GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'In GitHub, \"issues\" are used to track bugs, feature requests, and other tasks related to project management.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(527, 37, 'How can users contribute to a project on GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'Users can contribute to a project on GitHub by forking the project and submitting a pull request, which allows for proposed changes to be reviewed.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(528, 37, 'Which of the following is NOT a feature of GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'GitHub does not provide an integrated development environment (IDE); instead, it offers tools for code management, collaboration, and issue tracking.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(529, 37, 'What is the benefit of using GitHub for open-source projects?', 'multiple_choice', 'GitHub benefits open-source projects by increasing visibility and encouraging community contributions, fostering collaboration among developers.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(530, 37, 'What does the term \"pull request\" signify in GitHub?', 'multiple_choice', 'A \"pull request\" in GitHub signifies a proposal to merge code changes from one branch into another, allowing for review and discussion before integration.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26');
INSERT INTO `quiz_questions` (`id`, `quiz_id`, `question_text`, `question_type`, `explanation`, `hint`, `points`, `order_index`, `is_required`, `media_url`, `media_type`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(531, 37, 'Why is version control important in software development?', 'multiple_choice', 'Version control is important in software development because it enables developers to revert to previous code states and track changes over time, ensuring project integrity.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(532, 37, 'What is the role of a \"maintainer\" in a GitHub project?', 'multiple_choice', 'A \"maintainer\" in a GitHub project is responsible for overseeing the overall direction and health of the project, ensuring it remains active and sustainable.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:31:26', '2025-07-31 20:31:26'),
(533, 38, 'What is required for automatic transcript retrieval according to the video?', 'multiple_choice', 'The video states that automatic transcript retrieval necessitates OAuth authentication.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(534, 38, 'What is the primary purpose of the video titled \"How To GET Anthropic API Key (QUICK & EASY) 2025\"?', 'multiple_choice', 'The video aims to instruct viewers on how to obtain an Anthropic API key.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(535, 38, 'Which authentication method is emphasized for access to the API in the video?', 'multiple_choice', 'The video highlights the OAuth flow as the required method for authentication.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(536, 38, 'What might users need to do if they opt not to use the OAuth flow?', 'multiple_choice', 'Users are advised to manually add the transcript if they choose not to utilize the OAuth flow.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(537, 38, 'In what year is the guidance for obtaining the Anthropic API key relevant?', 'multiple_choice', 'The video is specifically titled with the year 2025, indicating the relevancy of the guidance.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(538, 38, 'What is implied about the ease of obtaining an Anthropic API key in the video title?', 'multiple_choice', 'The title suggests that the process of obtaining the key is designed to be quick and easy.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(539, 38, 'Which of the following is NOT mentioned as a method for obtaining transcript retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'The video does not mention the use of a third-party service for transcript retrieval.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(540, 38, 'Why is OAuth authentication considered necessary in the context of the video?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth authentication is necessary for securing access to the API and ensuring safe data retrieval.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(541, 38, 'What aspect of the API key retrieval process does the video focus on primarily?', 'multiple_choice', 'The video provides step-by-step instructions on how to obtain the Anthropic API key.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(542, 38, 'What can be inferred about the target audience for the video?', 'multiple_choice', 'The title indicates a focus on a quick and easy process, suggesting it is aimed at beginners in API usage.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(543, 38, 'Which of the following best summarizes the main action viewers should take after watching the video?', 'multiple_choice', 'The primary action suggested by the video is for viewers to obtain an Anthropic API key.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(544, 38, 'What does the video indicate about the relationship between OAuth and transcript retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'The video conveys that OAuth is essential for enabling automatic transcript retrieval.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(545, 38, 'What is likely the viewer\'s first step in the process described in the video?', 'multiple_choice', 'The first step for viewers is likely to sign up for an Anthropic account to obtain their API key.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(546, 38, 'How does the video characterize the retrieval process for the API key?', 'multiple_choice', 'The character of the retrieval process is framed as being quick and straightforward in the video\'s title.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(547, 38, 'What does the term \"OAuth flow\" refer to in the context of the video?', 'multiple_choice', 'The \"OAuth flow\" refers to a specific sequence of steps to authenticate a user for secure access.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:44:00', '2025-07-31 20:44:00'),
(560, 40, 'What is the primary purpose of JSON (JavaScript Object Notation)?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON is primarily designed for data interchange, allowing systems to communicate and exchange data in a structured format.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(561, 40, 'Which of the following best describes the structure of JSON data?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON data is structured as key-value pairs, often organized in arrays, which allows for easy data representation and access.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(562, 40, 'In JSON syntax, how are strings represented?', 'multiple_choice', 'In JSON, strings must be enclosed in double quotes to be correctly interpreted.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(563, 40, 'What data types are supported by JSON?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON supports various data types, including strings, numbers, objects, arrays, booleans, and null, allowing for rich data representation.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(564, 40, 'Which of the following is a valid JSON object structure?', 'multiple_choice', 'A valid JSON object consists of key-value pairs enclosed in curly braces, where keys are strings followed by a colon.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(565, 40, 'How does JSON compare to XML in terms of data representation?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON is generally considered easier for humans to read due to its simpler syntax compared to the more verbose structure of XML.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(566, 40, 'What is the significance of the \"null\" data type in JSON?', 'multiple_choice', 'The \"null\" data type in JSON signifies an absence of value or an undefined variable, which can be important for data integrity.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(567, 40, 'In which scenario would JSON be preferred over XML?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON is often preferred for its lightweight and human-readable format, making it suitable for APIs and web applications.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(568, 40, 'What is a common use case for JSON in web development?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON is widely used in web development for exchanging data between clients and servers, particularly in APIs.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(569, 40, 'Which tool or language is typically used to parse JSON?', 'multiple_choice', 'JavaScript includes built-in methods to parse and manipulate JSON data, making it a common choice for handling JSON in web environments.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(570, 40, 'What is the correct way to represent an array in JSON?', 'multiple_choice', 'An array in JSON is represented by square brackets containing a list of values, separated by commas.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(571, 40, 'Which statement about JSON is false?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON does not support data types like date and function; it is limited to strings, numbers, objects, arrays, booleans, and null.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(572, 40, 'How can JSON be beneficial in API responses?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON is beneficial in API responses because it allows for structured data that is easy to parse, making it efficient for data interchange.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(573, 40, 'Which of the following describes how to declare a JSON object with nested data?', 'multiple_choice', 'A JSON object can contain nested data structures, which are properly declared using curly braces within another object.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(574, 40, 'What is the key reason for using JSON over CSV for data interchange?', 'multiple_choice', 'JSON supports multiple data types, allowing for more complex data structures compared to CSV, which is limited to text and numerical data.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:45:23', '2025-07-31 20:45:23'),
(575, 41, 'What is the primary focus of the lesson titled \"The \'vibe coding\' mind virus explained\"?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson specifically addresses the concept of vibe coding as a mental phenomenon, which is central to the content discussed.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:47:33', '2025-07-31 20:47:33'),
(576, 41, 'Which of the following best describes \"vibe coding\"?', 'multiple_choice', 'Vibe coding refers to the interpretation of social cues and emotional states, highlighting how individuals perceive and respond to the vibes or feelings within social interactions.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:47:33', '2025-07-31 20:47:33'),
(577, 41, 'In the context of the lesson, what is meant by the term \"mind virus\"?', 'multiple_choice', 'The term \"mind virus\" is used to describe a pervasive idea or trend that can influence the way people think and behave, particularly in social contexts.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:47:33', '2025-07-31 20:47:33'),
(578, 41, 'How does vibe coding potentially affect interpersonal communication?', 'multiple_choice', 'Vibe coding can enhance interpersonal communication by improving individuals\' abilities to connect with and empathize with others through an understanding of emotional cues.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:47:33', '2025-07-31 20:47:33'),
(579, 41, 'Which of the following is NOT a characteristic of vibe coding?', 'multiple_choice', 'While vibe coding involves awareness and sensitivity to social cues, it does not inherently include the manipulation of interactions for personal gain.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-31 20:47:33', '2025-07-31 20:47:33'),
