(680, 47, 'What is one potential ethical concern associated with generative AI?', 'multiple_choice', 'A significant ethical concern regarding generative AI is its potential to produce misleading or harmful content, which can have serious repercussions in various contexts.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(681, 47, 'How do generative AI models typically improve over time?', 'multiple_choice', 'Generative AI models enhance their capabilities by analyzing new datasets, allowing them to refine their outputs and improve their performance.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(682, 47, 'What role do neural networks play in generative AI?', 'multiple_choice', 'Neural networks are a foundational component of generative AI, enabling the system to learn patterns and generate new content based on those patterns.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(683, 47, 'In which scenario would generative AI be most appropriately applied?', 'multiple_choice', 'Generative AI is particularly suited for creating personalized marketing content, as it can tailor messages based on user data and preferences.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(684, 47, 'Which of the following statements accurately describes the relationship between generative AI and creativity?', 'multiple_choice', 'Generative AI can simulate aspects of human creativity by generating novel outputs, drawing from the patterns it has learned from existing works.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(685, 47, 'What is a significant challenge faced by developers of generative AI systems?', 'multiple_choice', 'Developers often struggle with balancing the complexity of generative AI models while also maintaining computational efficiency to ensure optimal performance.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(686, 47, 'Which of the following is an example of a generative AI tool?', 'multiple_choice', 'An image generation program that creates art from text prompts exemplifies the capabilities of generative AI, demonstrating its ability to generate original content.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(687, 47, 'How does generative AI differ from traditional AI systems?', 'multiple_choice', 'Unlike traditional AI systems that primarily analyze existing data, generative AI is capable of creating new data, which distinguishes it from conventional approaches.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(688, 47, 'Why is user feedback considered important in the development of generative AI?', 'multiple_choice', 'User feedback is crucial in refining generative AI outputs, as it can significantly improve the relevance and quality of the content produced.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(689, 47, 'What is a potential benefit of implementing generative AI in business practices?', 'multiple_choice', 'Generative AI can greatly enhance efficiency in content creation and customization, allowing businesses to tailor their offerings to meet customer needs more effectively.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:03', '2025-08-01 12:50:03'),
(690, 48, 'Which authentication method is required for automatic transcript retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'The transcript specifies that automatic retrieval requires OAuth authentication.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(691, 48, 'What is the primary focus of Lesson 3B as indicated in the title?', 'multiple_choice', 'The title clearly indicates that the lesson addresses capabilities and limitations.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(692, 48, 'In the context of this lesson, what does \"OAuth flow\" refer to?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth flow is a process specifically designed for authenticating users securely.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(693, 48, 'Which of the following could be a limitation discussed in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'Limitations often include dependencies on external services, which can impact functionality.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(694, 48, 'What is the significance of understanding both capabilities and limitations in technology?', 'multiple_choice', 'Understanding both aspects enables users to maximize benefits while being cautious of risks.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(695, 48, 'Why might manual transcript addition be necessary according to the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson suggests that manual addition is a fallback when automatic retrieval methods are not available or reliable.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(696, 48, 'How does OAuth authentication enhance security in the context of transcript retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth allows secure access by using tokens, which protect sensitive user information from exposure.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(697, 48, 'In what scenario would a user opt for manual transcript addition?', 'multiple_choice', 'Users would resort to manual addition when they cannot use automatic retrieval methods.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(698, 48, 'What aspect of user engagement might be considered a limitation when using automatic transcript retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'Automatic systems may face delays or failures, impacting timely user engagement with transcripts.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(699, 48, 'What is the role of the \"AI Fluency: Framework & Foundations Course\" as suggested in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'The course aims to enhance understanding of AI\'s capabilities and limitations, supporting informed use of technology.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(700, 48, 'What could be a potential benefit of using OAuth authentication for users?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth allows users to authenticate once and access multiple services without repeated logins.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(701, 48, 'Which of the following best describes a \"capability\" in the context of technology?', 'multiple_choice', 'Capabilities refer to functions that improve or enhance the overall user experience with technology.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(702, 48, 'Why is it important for users to be aware of limitations when using technology?', 'multiple_choice', 'Awareness of limitations helps users set realistic expectations and make informed choices regarding technology use.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:43', '2025-08-01 12:50:43'),
(703, 48, 'How does understanding limitations contribute to effective technology use?', 'multiple_choice', 'Recognizing limitations equips users to proactively address challenges and seek solutions.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:44', '2025-08-01 12:50:44'),
(704, 48, 'Which of the following statements is true regarding the relationship between capabilities and limitations?', 'multiple_choice', 'A comprehensive understanding of both capabilities and limitations promotes more effective and informed technology usage.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:50:44', '2025-08-01 12:50:44'),
(705, 49, 'What is the primary purpose of delegation in a professional context?', 'multiple_choice', 'Delegation is primarily aimed at enhancing team efficacy and productivity by distributing tasks among team members.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(706, 49, 'Which of the following best describes the concept of accountability in delegation?', 'multiple_choice', 'In delegation, the individual who delegates retains accountability for the completion of tasks, even if others perform them.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(707, 49, 'What is a common challenge associated with delegation?', 'multiple_choice', 'A common challenge in delegation is identifying the appropriate tasks to delegate, which can hinder effective management.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(708, 49, 'How can effective delegation impact team dynamics?', 'multiple_choice', 'Effective delegation fosters collaboration and skill development, positively impacting team dynamics.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(709, 49, 'Which factor is crucial for successful delegation?', 'multiple_choice', 'Clear communication regarding tasks and expectations is crucial for successful delegation to ensure all parties understand their roles.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(710, 49, 'In the context of delegation, what does the term \'empowerment\' refer to?', 'multiple_choice', 'Empowerment in delegation refers to granting authority and responsibility to others, enabling them to make decisions and execute tasks.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(711, 49, 'Which of the following is NOT a benefit of delegation?', 'multiple_choice', 'While delegation can lead to improved efficiency and skill development, it should not increase the delegator\'s workload; rather, it should allow for a greater focus on strategic tasks.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(712, 49, 'What should a delegator consider when selecting a team member for a delegated task?', 'multiple_choice', 'A delegator should consider a team member\'s current workload and skillset to ensure the task is assigned appropriately and effectively.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(713, 49, 'Which of the following can undermine the effectiveness of delegation?', 'multiple_choice', 'A lack of trust in team members\' abilities can undermine the effectiveness of delegation, as it may lead to hesitance in entrusting tasks.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(714, 49, 'To whom does the responsibility for the outcome of a delegated task ultimately fall?', 'multiple_choice', 'The responsibility for the outcome of a delegated task ultimately falls to the delegator, even if the task is performed by another individual.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(715, 49, 'Which technique can improve the delegation process?', 'multiple_choice', 'Establishing regular check-ins to discuss progress can improve the delegation process by ensuring accountability and providing support.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(716, 49, 'What role does feedback play in the delegation process?', 'multiple_choice', 'Feedback plays a crucial role in improving future delegation and team performance by providing insights and opportunities for growth.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(717, 49, 'What is an appropriate first step when beginning the delegation process?', 'multiple_choice', 'Analyzing which tasks can be effectively delegated is an appropriate first step in the delegation process to ensure successful outcomes.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(718, 49, 'How does delegation relate to leadership development?', 'multiple_choice', 'Delegation relates to leadership development by providing opportunities for individuals to demonstrate initiative and responsibility, which are key leadership qualities.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26');
INSERT INTO `quiz_questions` (`id`, `quiz_id`, `question_text`, `question_type`, `explanation`, `hint`, `points`, `order_index`, `is_required`, `media_url`, `media_type`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(719, 49, 'What impact does ineffective delegation have on an organization?', 'multiple_choice', 'Ineffective delegation can lead to decreased morale and productivity, as employees may feel overwhelmed or undervalued.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:51:26', '2025-08-01 12:51:26'),
(720, 50, 'What is the primary purpose of OAuth authentication as mentioned in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson highlights that OAuth authentication is required specifically for the purpose of enabling automatic transcript retrieval.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(721, 50, 'Which of the following best describes the OAuth flow?', 'multiple_choice', 'The OAuth flow is a process that allows third-party applications to gain access to user data without sharing passwords, thereby enhancing security.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(722, 50, 'What key feature of OAuth authentication is emphasized in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson emphasizes that OAuth requires user consent for third-party applications to access their data, ensuring users retain control over their information.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(723, 50, 'In which scenario would OAuth authentication be particularly beneficial?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth authentication is beneficial when an application requires access to a user\'s social media account without the user needing to share their password, thus maintaining security.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(724, 50, 'Which statement best summarizes the main focus of Lesson 6?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson primarily focuses on the details of OAuth authentication and its role in automatic transcript retrieval.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(725, 50, 'How does OAuth authentication enhance user security compared to traditional methods?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth enhances security by using access tokens instead of passwords, thereby reducing the need for users to share their passwords with third parties.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(726, 50, 'What is a potential disadvantage of not using OAuth authentication?', 'multiple_choice', 'Without OAuth authentication, there is a greater risk of unauthorized access to user accounts as users may have to share their passwords directly with applications.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(727, 50, 'Which of the following is NOT a feature of OAuth authentication?', 'multiple_choice', 'Password sharing is not a feature of OAuth authentication; instead, OAuth uses access tokens to allow secure delegated access.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(728, 50, 'What is one of the implications of using OAuth for transcript retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'Using OAuth for transcript retrieval implies that integration with various platforms can be done seamlessly while maintaining user security.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(729, 50, 'What does OAuth stand for?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth stands for Open Authorization, which accurately reflects its purpose of allowing secure authorization without sharing passwords.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(730, 50, 'Which of the following is a common use case for OAuth authentication?', 'multiple_choice', 'A common use case for OAuth authentication is connecting applications with third-party services, allowing secure access to user data.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(731, 50, 'What is a major benefit of using tokens in OAuth authentication?', 'multiple_choice', 'A major benefit of using tokens in OAuth authentication is that they can be revoked without impacting the user\'s password, enhancing security.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(732, 50, 'Which of the following statements about OAuth authentication is true?', 'multiple_choice', 'The true statement regarding OAuth authentication is that it enables users to grant access to their information without sharing their passwords, making it a secure option.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(733, 50, 'What role does user consent play in OAuth authentication?', 'multiple_choice', 'User consent is a mandatory step in OAuth authentication, as it ensures that users are aware and agree to the access being granted to their data.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(734, 50, 'Which of the following is true regarding the security of OAuth tokens?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth tokens can become invalid after a set period, which enhances security by limiting their duration of use.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:52:15', '2025-08-01 12:52:15'),
(735, 51, 'What is the primary focus of Lesson 8 in the AI Fluency course?', 'multiple_choice', 'Lesson 8 specifically examines the concept of discernment within the framework of AI fluency.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(736, 51, 'Which of the following is most likely a key component of discernment as discussed in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'Discernment involves the ability to make informed and reasoned judgments, especially in the context of AI.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(737, 51, 'In the context of discernment, what is a fundamental challenge that individuals face?', 'multiple_choice', 'A significant challenge of discernment is the ability to differentiate between trustworthy and dubious information sources.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(738, 51, 'Which of the following best describes the relationship between discernment and critical thinking?', 'multiple_choice', 'Discernment can be seen as a component of critical thinking, which involves analyzing and evaluating information to make judgments.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(739, 51, 'What role does context play in the process of discernment?', 'multiple_choice', 'Context is crucial for understanding and interpreting information accurately, thereby enhancing the discernment process.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(740, 51, 'Which of the following skills is most likely to enhance an individual\'s discernment capabilities?', 'multiple_choice', 'Analytical thinking skills are essential for evaluating information and making sound judgments, thus improving discernment.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(741, 51, 'How does the lesson suggest one can improve discernment in the digital age?', 'multiple_choice', 'Continuous learning and critical evaluation of information sources are emphasized as methods to enhance discernment in a digital landscape.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(742, 51, 'What is the potential consequence of poor discernment in decision-making?', 'multiple_choice', 'Poor discernment can lead to misinterpretation of data and result in unfavorable decisions or outcomes.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(743, 51, 'Which of the following statements aligns with the lesson\'s approach to discernment?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson advocates that discernment can be developed through intentional practice and educational efforts.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(744, 51, 'What is an essential characteristic of a discerning individual according to the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'A discerning individual actively questions and validates the information they encounter, rather than accepting it at face value.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(745, 51, 'In the context of discernment, what is the significance of questioning assumptions?', 'multiple_choice', 'Questioning assumptions fosters a deeper understanding and critical evaluation of information, which is vital for effective discernment.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(746, 51, 'What aspect of discernment is emphasized as particularly important in a rapidly changing information environment?', 'multiple_choice', 'Adaptability and continuous learning are crucial for maintaining effective discernment in an ever-evolving information landscape.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(747, 51, 'Which of the following best captures the importance of discernment in the context of artificial intelligence?', 'multiple_choice', 'Discernment is vital for navigating the ethical implications of AI and for making responsible, informed choices regarding its use.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(748, 51, 'What can hinder a person\'s ability to exercise discernment effectively?', 'multiple_choice', 'Cognitive biases and preconceived notions can obstruct a person\'s ability to exercise discernment effectively by clouding judgment.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(749, 51, 'Which practice is recommended to enhance one\'s discernment skills?', 'multiple_choice', 'Engaging in discussions that include diverse perspectives is recommended to foster and enhance discernment skills.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:15', '2025-08-01 12:53:15'),
(750, 52, 'What is the primary focus of Lesson 10 in the AI Fluency course?', 'multiple_choice', 'Lesson 10 is specifically centered on the concept of diligence within the framework of AI fluency.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(751, 52, 'Which of the following best describes the term \'diligence\' as presented in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'Diligence is characterized as consistent and careful effort towards achieving goals.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(752, 52, 'Why is diligence considered essential in the context of AI?', 'multiple_choice', 'Diligence is crucial in ensuring that ethical considerations are maintained during AI development.', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(753, 52, 'According to the lesson, which of the following is NOT a component of diligence?', 'multiple_choice', 'Spontaneity is not a component of diligence; rather, diligence requires focus and persistence.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(754, 52, 'How does the lesson suggest one can improve their diligence?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson suggests that improving diligence involves setting clear goals and having a structured approach.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(755, 52, 'In the context of the lesson, which of the following best exemplifies a diligent individual?', 'multiple_choice', 'A diligent individual is characterized by consistency in meeting deadlines and thorough review of their work.', NULL, 1.00, 6, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(756, 52, 'What role does feedback play in the pursuit of diligence, according to the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'Feedback is crucial as it aids individuals in recognizing their strengths and areas needing improvement.', NULL, 1.00, 7, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(757, 52, 'The lesson indicates that diligence can lead to which of the following outcomes?', 'multiple_choice', 'Diligence is associated with increased mastery of skills through dedicated effort and practice.', NULL, 1.00, 8, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(758, 52, 'Which of the following strategies is recommended to maintain diligence over time?', 'multiple_choice', 'Regularly reviewing progress and adjusting goals is recommended to sustain diligence over time.', NULL, 1.00, 9, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(759, 52, 'How can cultivating a culture of diligence impact a team in an AI context?', 'multiple_choice', 'Cultivating a culture of diligence fosters collaboration and accountability within a team.', NULL, 1.00, 10, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(760, 52, 'What is one potential barrier to demonstrating diligence as discussed in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'A lack of clear direction or goals can hinder one\'s ability to demonstrate diligence effectively.', NULL, 1.00, 11, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(761, 52, 'The lesson emphasizes that diligence is a skill that can be developed. Which of the following is a method mentioned for developing this skill?', 'multiple_choice', 'Engaging in reflective practices is highlighted as a key method for developing the skill of diligence.', NULL, 1.00, 12, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(762, 52, 'What is a common misconception about diligence as outlined in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'The misconception is that diligence is an innate trait rather than a skill that can be cultivated through practice.', NULL, 1.00, 13, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(763, 52, 'According to the lesson, how does diligence relate to long-term success in AI projects?', 'multiple_choice', 'Diligence is directly linked to the timely and high-quality completion of AI projects, contributing to long-term success.', NULL, 1.00, 14, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(764, 52, 'In the context of the lesson, what is the relationship between diligence and innovation?', 'multiple_choice', 'Diligence supports innovation by enabling careful experimentation and iterative improvements.', NULL, 1.00, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:53:53', '2025-08-01 12:53:53'),
(765, 53, 'What is the primary requirement for automatic transcript retrieval mentioned in the lesson?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson specifies that automatic transcript retrieval necessitates OAuth authentication.', NULL, 1.00, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:54:39', '2025-08-01 12:54:39'),
(766, 53, 'Which authentication method is suggested for accessing the transcript automatically?', 'multiple_choice', 'The transcript highlights the use of the OAuth flow to facilitate automatic retrieval.', NULL, 1.00, 2, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:54:40', '2025-08-01 12:54:40'),
(767, 53, 'What type of course is referenced in the lesson title?', 'multiple_choice', 'The lesson is part of the \"AI Fluency: Framework & Foundations Course.\"', NULL, 1.00, 3, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:54:40', '2025-08-01 12:54:40'),
(768, 53, 'In the context of the lesson, what does \"OAuth\" primarily relate to?', 'multiple_choice', 'OAuth is a protocol used for authentication, specifically for secure access to resources.', NULL, 1.00, 4, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:54:40', '2025-08-01 12:54:40'),
(769, 53, 'Why might a user choose to manually add a transcript rather than using automatic retrieval?', 'multiple_choice', 'Users may opt to manually add a transcript if they do not possess OAuth authentication credentials.', NULL, 1.00, 5, 1, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 12:54:40', '2025-08-01 12:54:40'),
