(2243, 561, 'To enable offline access to the application', 0, 'OAuth is not related to offline access.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2244, 561, 'To automatically update the application', 0, 'OAuth does not handle application updates.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2245, 562, 'Downloading the installer', 0, 'This is a standard part of the installation process.', 0, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2246, 562, 'Running the installer', 0, 'This is also part of installing software.', 1, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2247, 562, 'Configuring user preferences', 0, 'This is often done post-installation.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2248, 562, 'Setting up a payment method', 1, 'Correct! Setting up a payment method is not typically part of the installation process.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2249, 563, 'Contact customer support', 0, 'While support may help, it\'s not the immediate alternative.', 0, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2250, 563, 'Manually add the transcript', 1, 'Correct! Users can manually add transcripts if automatic retrieval fails.', 1, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2251, 563, 'Reinstall the application', 0, 'Reinstalling is not necessary for this issue.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2252, 563, 'Wait for the next software update', 0, 'Waiting does not resolve the immediate problem.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2253, 564, 'It requires less user interaction', 0, 'OAuth flow often requires user interaction to log in.', 0, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2254, 564, 'It offers enhanced security for credentials', 1, 'Correct! OAuth helps to secure user credentials.', 1, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2255, 564, 'It guarantees automatic updates', 0, 'OAuth does not handle updates.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2256, 564, 'It allows multiple users to access one account', 0, 'OAuth is about security, not account sharing.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2257, 565, 'It improves the application\'s performance', 0, 'Manual addition doesn\'t affect performance.', 0, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2258, 565, 'It allows continued use of features without automatic retrieval', 1, 'Correct! Manual addition keeps features accessible.', 1, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2259, 565, 'It provides a backup of transcripts', 0, 'While it may help, backup is not the main benefit.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2260, 565, 'It reduces the need for user authentication', 0, 'Manual addition still requires authentication.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2261, 566, 'During installation of the software', 0, 'OAuth is not needed at installation.', 0, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2262, 566, 'When accessing transcripts', 1, 'Correct! OAuth is crucial for accessing transcripts.', 1, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2263, 566, 'When configuring user preferences', 0, 'OAuth is not related to preference settings.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2264, 566, 'When updating the software', 0, 'OAuth does not apply to software updates.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2265, 567, 'Inability to download the application', 0, 'Downloading does not require OAuth.', 0, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2266, 567, 'Inability to access certain features', 1, 'Correct! Without OAuth, users can\'t access certain features.', 1, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2267, 567, 'Loss of previously saved data', 0, 'OAuth does not affect saved data.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2268, 567, 'Automatic updates will be disabled', 0, 'OAuth is unrelated to update settings.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2269, 568, 'Reinstall the application', 0, 'Reinstallation is not necessary.', 0, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2270, 568, 'Find the manual addition option in the application', 1, 'Correct! You must find the option to add transcripts manually.', 1, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2271, 568, 'Contact support for help', 0, 'Support may not be necessary for this action.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2272, 568, 'Wait for the next update', 0, 'Waiting will not help you add a transcript.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2273, 569, 'It is optional for all features', 0, 'OAuth is not optional for key functionalities.', 0, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2274, 569, 'It is required for accessing secure features', 1, 'Correct! OAuth is needed for secure access.', 1, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2275, 569, 'It is only needed for installation', 0, 'OAuth is not required during installation.', 2, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2276, 569, 'It is only used for updates', 0, 'OAuth is not related to updates.', 3, '2025-08-03 12:47:27'),
(2277, 570, 'It requires programming skills to use.', 0, 'This is incorrect. n8n is user-friendly and does not require programming expertise.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2278, 570, 'It is open-source and can be self-hosted.', 1, 'Correct! n8n is open-source, allowing users to host it locally.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2279, 570, 'It is cloud-based only.', 0, 'This statement is false; n8n can be run locally.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2280, 570, 'It is limited to specific integrations.', 0, 'This is incorrect. n8n supports a wide range of integrations.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2281, 571, 'Creating a simple to-do list.', 0, 'While possible, this is not the best use case for n8n.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2282, 571, 'Integrating a CRM with an email marketing service.', 1, 'Correct! This is a common use case for automating workflows.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2283, 571, 'Updating a spreadsheet manually.', 0, 'This does not leverage n8n\'s automation capabilities.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2284, 571, 'Sending a single email notification.', 0, 'This is too simple for n8n\'s capabilities.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2285, 572, 'A list of tasks to complete.', 0, 'This is not accurate; workflows are automated processes.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2286, 572, 'Automated processes that integrate multiple applications.', 1, 'Correct! Workflows automate tasks across various apps.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2287, 572, 'Scheduled reminders for users.', 0, 'This is too narrow; workflows encompass more than reminders.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2288, 572, 'Manual entries into a database.', 0, 'Workflows are about automation, not manual tasks.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2289, 573, 'Data is stored in the cloud by default.', 0, 'This is incorrect; n8n can be run locally.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2290, 573, 'Users can choose to host it locally.', 1, 'Correct! Local hosting enhances data privacy.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2291, 573, 'It encrypts data automatically.', 0, 'While security is important, local hosting is the main privacy feature.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2292, 573, 'It provides no privacy features.', 0, 'This is incorrect as n8n offers significant privacy control.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2293, 574, 'Start building complex workflows immediately.', 0, 'It\'s better to start with understanding the tool first.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2294, 574, 'Watch introductory tutorials.', 1, 'Correct! Tutorials help understand n8n\'s features.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2295, 574, 'Ignore documentation and learn by trial and error.', 0, 'This may lead to confusion; documentation is helpful.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2296, 574, 'Install multiple plugins right away.', 0, 'Focus on understanding the core functionality first.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2297, 575, 'It provides a user interface for n8n.', 0, 'OAuth is not related to the user interface.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2298, 575, 'It allows secure access to other services.', 1, 'Correct! OAuth ensures secure connections to APIs.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2299, 575, 'It is a programming language used in n8n.', 0, 'This is incorrect; OAuth is not a programming language.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2300, 575, 'It is an alternative to local hosting.', 0, 'OAuth is about authentication, not hosting options.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2301, 576, 'Manually managing a calendar.', 0, 'This is inefficient; n8n can automate this task.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2302, 576, 'Automating email responses based on specific criteria.', 1, 'Correct! Automating responses can save time.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2303, 576, 'Writing a daily journal by hand.', 0, 'This task does not leverage n8n\'s capabilities.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2304, 576, 'Creating a paper-based filing system.', 0, 'n8n is focused on digital automation, not paper systems.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2305, 577, 'There is no community support.', 0, 'This is incorrect; n8n has a supportive community.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2306, 577, 'Users collaborate to improve workflows.', 1, 'Correct! Collaboration is a key feature of n8n\'s community.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2307, 577, 'Users must pay for community access.', 0, 'Community support is generally free.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2308, 577, 'Community members cannot share workflows.', 0, 'This is incorrect; sharing workflows is encouraged.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2309, 578, 'It is only for advanced programmers.', 1, 'Correct! n8n is designed for all skill levels.', 0, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2310, 578, 'It can only automate simple tasks.', 0, 'This is incorrect; n8n can handle complex workflows too.', 1, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2311, 578, 'It requires a subscription fee.', 0, 'n8n is free to use, although optional paid features may exist.', 2, '2025-08-12 02:04:17'),
(2312, 578, 'It has no integration capabilities.', 0, 'This is false; n8n excels in integration with various apps.', 3, '2025-08-12 02:04:17');
INSERT INTO `skills_drill_questions` (`id`, `drill_id`, `question_text`, `explanation`, `hint`, `difficulty_level`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 1, 'What is the main benefit of using Agile in project management?', 'The main benefit of Agile is its flexibility in adapting to changing requirements, which is particularly valuable in dynamic project environments.', 'Consider how Agile adapts to changes.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(2, 1, 'Which of the following best describes a key principle of Agile?', 'A key principle of Agile is to involve the customer throughout the development process to ensure the final product meets their needs.', 'Think about customer involvement.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(3, 1, 'During which Agile event do team members reflect on their performance and processes?', 'The Retrospective meeting allows team members to reflect on their work and identify areas for improvement.', 'It\'s about looking back to improve.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(4, 1, 'What is the role of the Product Owner in Agile?', 'The Product Owner is responsible for managing the product backlog and ensuring that the team delivers value to the customer.', 'Think about who manages the project priorities.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(5, 1, 'In Agile, what is the purpose of a backlog refinement session?', 'Backlog refinement sessions help the team clarify and prioritize backlog items, ensuring that they are well-defined for future sprints.', 'Consider how the team prepares for upcoming work.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(6, 1, 'How does Agile encourage team collaboration?', 'Agile promotes team collaboration through regular meetings such as Daily Stand-ups, where team members share updates and challenges.', 'Think about the frequency of meetings.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(7, 1, 'What is a key outcome of a Sprint Review?', 'The key outcome of a Sprint Review is to demonstrate the work completed during the sprint to stakeholders and gather their feedback.', 'Consider what the team demonstrates during this event.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(8, 1, 'What distinguishes Agile from traditional project management approaches?', 'Agile distinguishes itself by being iterative and flexible, allowing for changes in requirements throughout the project lifecycle, unlike traditional methods which often follow a linear approach.', 'Think about the approach to change management.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(9, 1, 'What is the function of time-boxing in Agile?', 'Time-boxing in Agile helps teams focus their efforts on delivering specific outcomes within a set period, enhancing productivity and ensuring regular progress.', 'Consider how time constraints affect project tasks.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:06:12', '2025-08-02 00:06:12'),
(10, 2, 'What is the main focus of the Agile methodology in project management?', 'Agile methodology primarily focuses on customer collaboration and adapting to change, rather than following a strict plan.', 'Think about the approach to changes and customer input.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 00:10:33', '2025-08-02 00:10:33'),
(11, 2, 'In a Hybrid project management approach, what is a key advantage?', 'A Hybrid approach allows project managers to leverage the strengths of both Agile and Waterfall methodologies, offering flexibility and structure.', 'Consider how different methodologies can complement each other.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:10:34', '2025-08-02 00:10:34'),
(12, 2, 'Which scenario best illustrates when to use the Waterfall methodology?', 'Waterfall is best suited for projects with well-defined requirements that are unlikely to change, such as construction or manufacturing projects.', 'Consider projects with clear requirements and limited changes.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:10:34', '2025-08-02 00:10:34'),
(13, 2, 'Which of the following is a common practice in Agile project management?', 'Daily stand-up meetings are a common practice in Agile to enhance team communication and ensure everyone is aligned.', 'Think about team interactions and feedback.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 00:10:34', '2025-08-02 00:10:34'),
(14, 2, 'What is a primary risk of using the Waterfall methodology?', 'A primary risk of Waterfall is its inflexibility; once a phase is completed, it can be difficult and costly to go back and make changes.', 'Think about project changes and responsiveness.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:10:34', '2025-08-02 00:10:34'),
(15, 2, 'How can project managers measure progress in an Agile framework?', 'Burndown charts are a common tool in Agile to visually track the amount of work remaining in a project.', 'Consider methods that visualize work completed over time.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:10:34', '2025-08-02 00:10:34'),
(16, 2, 'Which statement best reflects the Agile principle of delivering working software frequently?', 'The Agile principle emphasizes delivering functional software in short, consistent intervals to ensure quick feedback and improvements.', 'Think about the frequency and nature of releases in Agile.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:10:34', '2025-08-02 00:10:34'),
(17, 2, 'What role does a Scrum Master play in an Agile team?', 'A Scrum Master serves as a facilitator for the Agile team, helping to remove obstacles and ensuring that the team follows Agile principles.', 'Consider the facilitator and supporter aspect of the role.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:10:34', '2025-08-02 00:10:34'),
(18, 2, 'In which situation is it most beneficial to adopt a Hybrid approach to project management?', 'A Hybrid approach is particularly beneficial in projects that have both stable requirements (suitable for Waterfall) and areas needing flexibility (suitable for Agile).', 'Think about projects with diverse requirements.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:10:34', '2025-08-02 00:10:34'),
(19, 3, 'Which of the following tags is used to create a line break in HTML?', 'The <br> tag is used to create a line break in HTML, allowing text to continue on the next line without starting a new paragraph.', 'Think about how you would separate lines within text.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(20, 3, 'What is the purpose of the <meta> tag in an HTML document?', 'The <meta> tag provides metadata about the HTML document, such as character set, author, and viewport settings, which can be used by browsers and search engines.', 'Consider how metadata relates to the document.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(21, 3, 'Which attribute is used to set the target for a hyperlink?', 'The \'target\' attribute is used with the <a> tag to specify where to open the linked document (like \'_blank\' for a new tab).', 'Think about how links can open in different places.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(22, 3, 'What is the correct way to create a checkbox in HTML?', 'The <input> tag with type=\'checkbox\' creates a checkbox in HTML forms.', 'Consider the input types available in forms.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(23, 3, 'How do you define a list item in an ordered list in HTML?', 'The <li> tag is used to define each list item in both ordered (<ol>) and unordered lists (<ul>).', 'Think about the tags used to create list elements.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(24, 3, 'Which HTML tag is used to create a dropdown list?', 'The <select> tag is used to create a dropdown list, and <option> tags define the choices within it.', 'Think about form elements that allow selection.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(25, 3, 'What does the <style> tag in the <head> section of an HTML document do?', 'The <style> tag is used to define internal CSS styles that apply to the HTML document.', 'Consider how styles are applied to HTML documents.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(26, 3, 'Which of the following is the correct way to include an external CSS file in an HTML document?', 'To include an external CSS file, you use the <link> tag with rel=\'stylesheet\' and href=\'path/to/style.css\'.', 'Think about the <link> tag\'s attributes.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(27, 3, 'What is the purpose of the <footer> tag in an HTML document?', 'The <footer> tag is used to define the footer section of a document, which typically contains copyright information, links, and authorship details.', 'Think about where you would find information at the bottom of a webpage.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:15:22', '2025-08-02 00:15:22'),
(28, 3, 'What is the correct way to start an HTML document?', 'The document should start with a DOCTYPE declaration, specifically <!DOCTYPE html> for HTML5.', 'Look for the declaration that indicates the document type.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(29, 3, 'Which tag is used to create a line break in HTML?', 'The <br> tag is used to create a line break in HTML, and it is a self-closing tag.', 'Think about a tag that does not require a closing tag.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(30, 3, 'In an HTML document, where is the <meta> tag usually placed?', 'The <meta> tag is typically placed within the <head> section of an HTML document to provide metadata such as character set or viewport settings.', 'This tag provides metadata about the HTML document.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(31, 3, 'Which attribute is used to specify the URL of a linked document?', 'The \'href\' attribute in the <a> tag specifies the URL of the page the link goes to.', 'Consider the tag used for hyperlinks.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(32, 3, 'What is the purpose of the <footer> tag in an HTML document?', 'The <footer> tag is used to define a footer for a document or section, often containing information like the author, copyright, links to related documents, etc.', 'Think about where you would typically find additional information about the document.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(33, 3, 'How can you create a checkbox input in an HTML form?', 'You can create a checkbox input by using the <input> tag with the type attribute set to \'checkbox\'.', 'Consider the type attribute of an input element.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(34, 3, 'What does the <ol> tag represent in HTML?', 'The <ol> tag is used to define an ordered list, which displays items in a numbered format.', 'Think about lists that require numbering.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(35, 3, 'Which of the following tags is used to define the main content of the document?', 'The <main> tag is used to define the main content of an HTML document, which is distinct from other sections like headers and footers.', 'Consider semantic elements that represent the main content.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(36, 3, 'Which attribute would you use to specify a fallback text for an <audio> or <video> element?', 'The \'alt\' attribute is not used for <audio> or <video>; instead, the <track> element is used for subtitles or captions. For fallback content, you use inner text within the <audio> or <video> tags.', 'Consider attributes that provide alternative content for unsupported media.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 00:34:11', '2025-08-02 00:34:11'),
(37, 4, 'What is one primary function of AI agents in automated systems?', 'AI agents are primarily designed to perform specific tasks without human intervention, allowing for automation in various applications.', 'Think about the tasks AI agents are designed to perform.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(38, 4, 'Which of the following best describes the adaptability of AI agents?', 'Adaptability in AI agents refers to their ability to learn from new data and experiences, thereby improving their performance over time.', 'Consider how AI agents respond to new information.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(39, 4, 'In what way can AI agents enhance decision-making processes?', 'AI agents can process large volumes of data quickly, identifying patterns and insights that assist in making informed decisions.', 'Think about the data analysis capabilities of AI agents.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(40, 4, 'How do AI agents typically handle unforeseen situations?', 'AI agents handle unforeseen situations by utilizing their learning algorithms to adapt and optimize their responses based on previous experiences and new data.', 'Consider the concept of learning and adjustments.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(41, 4, 'What is a critical ethical concern related to the deployment of AI agents?', 'A critical ethical concern is the potential for bias in AI algorithms, which can lead to unfair treatment or discrimination based on the data used for training.', 'Think about the implications of decision-making by AI.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(42, 4, 'Which of the following applications is NOT typically associated with AI agents?', 'AI agents are not typically associated with tasks that require high emotional intelligence, such as personal counseling, as they lack human empathy.', 'Consider the nature of the tasks AI agents are designed to perform.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(43, 4, 'What role does user feedback play in the effectiveness of AI agents?', 'User feedback is crucial as it helps AI agents refine their algorithms and improve their performance by learning from mistakes and successes.', 'Consider how feedback influences learning processes.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(44, 4, 'What is a common misconception about the capabilities of AI agents?', 'A common misconception is that AI agents can fully understand and replicate human emotions and decision-making processes, which is not accurate as they operate based on algorithms and data.', 'Think about the comparison between AI agents and human abilities.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(45, 4, 'Which of the following is a primary benefit of using AI agents in business?', 'One primary benefit of using AI agents in business is the increased efficiency they bring by automating routine tasks, allowing human employees to focus on more complex work.', 'Think about efficiency and task management.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 22:57:03', '2025-08-02 22:57:03'),
(46, 9, 'What does the term \'context window\' refer to in the context of language models?', 'The \'context window\' refers to the amount of text or data that a language model can consider at one time to make predictions or generate responses.', 'Think about how information is processed in relation to other information.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(47, 9, 'Why is the context window important for language models?', 'A larger context window allows the model to understand and generate more coherent and contextually relevant responses, as it can consider more information from the input.', 'Consider how context affects understanding and generation of language.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(48, 9, 'What is a potential limitation of a small context window?', 'A small context window may cause the model to miss important information, leading to less relevant or coherent responses, especially in complex queries.', 'Think about the implications of processing less text.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(49, 9, 'How can increasing the context window benefit users?', 'Increasing the context window can help the model provide more relevant answers by considering more of the conversation history or input, thus enhancing user experience.', 'Consider how conversations and queries are structured.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(50, 9, 'Which of the following best describes the relationship between context window size and model performance?', 'Generally, a larger context window can enhance model performance by providing more context for understanding, but there is a point where increases yield diminishing returns.', 'Think about the balance between quantity of context and quality of output.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(51, 9, 'What might be a reason for a developer to choose a smaller context window?', 'Developers might opt for a smaller context window to improve processing speed or reduce resource usage, especially in applications where immediate responses are prioritized over depth of analysis.', 'Consider trade-offs in system resources and applications.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(52, 9, 'In what way can context windows vary between different language models?', 'Different language models can have varying context window sizes based on their design, intended use cases, and computational capabilities, influencing their effectiveness in specific tasks.', 'Think about the design and purpose of different models.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(53, 9, 'What happens to a model\'s understanding if the context window is too small for a given task?', 'If the context window is too small, the model may misinterpret the meaning or intent behind user input, leading to incorrect or irrelevant responses.', 'Consider the impact of limited information on comprehension.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(54, 9, 'What is a practical example of a task that may require a large context window?', 'Tasks such as summarization of long documents or complex conversations benefit from a large context window to retain and understand all relevant information.', 'Think about tasks that involve complex information across multiple sentences.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 23:13:11', '2025-08-02 23:13:11'),
(55, 10, 'What is the primary function of AI agents?', 'AI agents are designed to perform tasks autonomously, often making decisions based on data and algorithms.', 'Consider what tasks AI agents are designed to perform.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
(56, 10, 'Which of the following best describes the decision-making process of AI agents?', 'AI agents use algorithms and data analysis to make decisions autonomously rather than relying on human judgment.', 'Think about how AI agents analyze data to make decisions.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
(57, 10, 'In what scenarios are AI agents most effectively applied?', 'AI agents are most effective in scenarios that require data analysis, pattern recognition, and decision-making without human intervention.', 'Consider environments where data-driven decisions are critical.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
(58, 10, 'What is a key characteristic of an AI agent that differentiates it from traditional programming?', 'A key characteristic of AI agents is their ability to learn and adapt from experience, which traditional programs do not possess.', 'Think about the level of autonomy an AI agent has.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
(59, 10, 'How do AI agents improve their performance over time?', 'AI agents improve their performance through machine learning, where they analyze data and learn from their outcomes to make better decisions in the future.', 'Consider the role of data in their operation.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
(60, 10, 'What technology often underpins the functioning of AI agents?', 'Machine learning algorithms are often the technology that powers AI agents, allowing them to process data and make decisions.', 'Think about the systems that enable AI to analyze and learn from data.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
(61, 10, 'What ethical considerations should be taken into account when developing AI agents?', 'Ethical considerations include ensuring fairness, accountability, transparency, and the potential impact on jobs and privacy.', 'Consider the impact of decisions made by autonomous systems.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
(62, 10, 'What is a potential risk associated with AI agents making autonomous decisions?', 'A potential risk is that AI agents may make biased or harmful decisions if not properly trained or monitored.', 'Think about the implications of decisions made without human oversight.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
(63, 10, 'Which area is NOT typically associated with the application of AI agents?', 'AI agents are not typically associated with purely creative fields where human intuition and emotion are key.', 'Think about fields where human creativity is paramount.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:14:02', '2025-08-02 23:14:02'),
