(91, 14, 'What does CSS stand for?', 'CSS stands for Cascading Style Sheets. It is used to style and layout web pages.', 'Think about the role of CSS in web development.', 'easy', '2025-08-02 23:17:22', '2025-08-02 23:17:22'),
(92, 14, 'Which of the following is NOT a valid way to add CSS to a web page?', 'Using inline styles, internal styles, and external styles are valid methods of adding CSS, but using a non-standard method is not.', 'Consider the methods of including styles in HTML.', 'medium', '2025-08-02 23:17:22', '2025-08-02 23:17:22'),
