(97, 14, 'Which CSS selector would you use to select all <p> elements inside a <div>?', 'The selector \'div p\' selects all <p> elements that are descendants of <div> elements.', 'Consider the relationship between the tags.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 23:17:22', '2025-08-02 23:17:22'),
