(99, 14, 'What does the \'z-index\' property control in CSS?', '\'z-index\' controls the vertical stacking order of elements that overlap, with higher values appearing on top.', 'Think about stacking order of elements.', 'hard', '2025-08-02 23:17:22', '2025-08-02 23:17:22'),
