(30, 'troutwayne@gmail.com', 'user', '$2y$12$9S.GEj8UShSd.UqwQUZ0.eYKziUstsejVreDBnGmNdH2m3AoIriki', NULL, 1, 'Wayne', 'Trout', NULL, '', 'wtrout187', 'all', 'avatar_30_1753547693.jpg', 'Currently I am a Contracts Manager for a Global Telecommunications company but I have worn all the hats in the corporate world. PjM, NPI, Procurement, Inside Sales Manager, Warehouse and Manufacturing Manager. Found AI and vibe coding a few years ago. I can vibe code with the best and probably struggle writing a python script, I use all the tools, multiple languages just to see how they work (Rust is pretty bad ass). Married, 6 kids and scared to death of getting let go because of a horrible job market and age.  I pride myself on being persistent enough to figure out anything if I have the need. Right now I have to figure this out so I stop surviving counting on someone else and thriving, because after a life of making other people rich and successful it’s my turn dam it. I owe it to myself, my family and the world to do great things and be happy, secure and doing something where I am only limited by my imagination. Dont get me wrong I understand the startup world but at least I have some control in that, can navigate it and know a few guys in the SaaS space that would help me for sure. At this point it can\'t be any riskier than the dam corporate world. Let\'s kick this world in the ass and make our dreams come true together!!', 'Django, Git, Github, VS Code (github copilot), windows/mac/linux(limited but figured out arch and others), Warp, Amazon q, Gemini CLI, Cursor, perplexity, you.com, ms Project, jira, confluence, AutoHotKey, VBA, PCBA assembly front to back (SMT-BurnIn/Boxbuild), numerous inventory systems, Pentesting (limited), built some phone apps (iphone and android), global procurement.', 0, '95e50882bb418d8d07214996892fd131', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, '2025-08-31 23:43:11', '2025-07-24 05:57:10', '2025-08-31 23:43:11', 'beginner', 3, 15, 'Python, Rust, Javascript, CSS, HTML